# Changelog

All notable changes to the RadioMaster Kazakh Voice Pack will be documented in this file.

## [1.0.0] — 2026

### Added

- Initial Kazakh voice localization.
- Kazakh system voice messages.
- Kazakh warnings and notifications.
- Kazakh technical terminology.
- Initial public release.

### Authors

Kazakh localization: Duman Kanatuly Shaker

Voice: Aiym Toktarbekova Toktarbekkyzy

